# 📦 Inventory Management System

A modern Inventory Management System built using the MERN Stack to help businesses manage products, sales, customers, payments, and inventory from a single dashboard.

---

# 🚀 Project Overview

This application is designed for shop owners and small businesses to manage their complete inventory lifecycle.

The system provides a real-time dashboard where the owner can instantly see:

- Today's Sales
- Monthly Revenue
- Total Products
- Customers
- Pending Payments
- Low Stock Alerts
- Recent Sales
- Inventory Status

Instead of manually maintaining Excel sheets, every inventory operation is updated automatically.

---

# 🎯 Project Goal

The main objective is to build a fast, secure, and user-friendly inventory management application that can:

- Track stock
- Record sales
- Manage customers
- Track pending payments
- Generate reports
- Visualize business growth

---

# 🛠 Tech Stack

## Frontend

- React.js
- React Router
- Axios
- Context API
- CSS3
- Recharts

## Backend

- Node.js
- Express.js
- JWT Authentication
- bcryptjs

## Database

- MongoDB
- Mongoose

