## Dashboard

The dashboard gives a complete overview of the business.

### Dashboard Cards

- Today's Sales
- Total Products
- Monthly Sales
- Customers
- Pending Payments

Each card contains

- Current Value
- Growth Percentage
- Small Trend Graph

---

## Sales Module

Features

- Create Sale
- Multiple Products in One Sale
