# 📊 Dashboard Sections

## Greeting Section

Displays

Good Morning, User

along with today's date.

---

## Statistics Cards

Shows important business metrics.

- Today's Sales
- Total Products
- Monthly Revenue
- Customers
- Pending Payments

---

## Sales Overview

A line chart displaying revenue growth.

User can filter by

- Weekly
- Monthly
- Yearly

---

## Inventory Status

A Doughnut Chart displaying

🟢 In Stock

🟡 Low Stock

🔴 Out of Stock

---

## Quick Actions

Quick buttons

- New Sale
- Add Product
- Add Customer
- Receive Payment

---

## Recent Sales

Shows latest invoices.

Information includes

- Customer Name
- Invoice Number
- Amount
- Payment Status

---

## Low Stock Alerts

Displays products that are about to run out.

Example

- Wireless Mouse
- HDMI Cable
- Mechanical Keyboard

